{"1525290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "OddFauna : Secret of the Terrabeast", "steam_appid": 1525290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525290/extras/2e10449832ab420355acc73d376a3c2d.poster.avif?t=1782492179\" width=356 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525290/extras/2e10449832ab420355acc73d376a3c2d.webm?t=1782492179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525290/extras/2e10449832ab420355acc73d376a3c2d.mp4?t=1782492179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Discover a colorful HAND-SCULPTED sandbox adventure </strong>where you grow your own world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Everything in OddFauna is sculpted in clay and painted by hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Befriend wild beasts</strong>, adventure across strange lands. Forage, craft, and build yourself a cozy shelter to stay safe from the elements, all on the back of a TerraBeast. Each character, item and plant in the game is hand-sculpted in clay!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Astor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are an Astor</strong>, a tiny but mighty beast that grows <strong>a living world called a TerraBeast</strong>. You form a special bond, living on their back and nurturing them by collecting diverse flora and fauna to join you on this little living world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beasts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world is filled with OddFauna for you to meet.</strong>  Give them their favorite treats to show you care. Earn their trust and you will receive items, recipes, or maybe even a new party member. Many have special skills to share once befriended. Some are easily found, while other rare types may take some serious exploring to discover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The TerraBeast </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This living world starts out quite small. By nurturing it and building a vibrant biome of flora and fauna on their back, they will grow bigger and bigger, being able to support more life and unlocking new abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your TerraBeast home can migrate to different biomes, exploring mountains, forests, grasslands and archipelagos. Discover lots of new beasts and forgeables in each region. Beware the blighted regions, unless you are properly prepared!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Terraform and grow</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transform your TerraBeast into your own unique paradise. </strong>Terraform the ground like clay: <strong>carve rivers and lakes</strong> to play in, <strong>raise mountains</strong> to gain a better view or <strong>create fields</strong> to farm your favorite treats.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices have an impact on the other OddFauna.</strong> Ovoks love forests, Logurs need lots of water, and Trico's love it hot! Be thoughtful of the diverse flora you plant on your TerraBeast, different environments will attract different beasts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your own crops! There are many different seeds available to grow your very own garden. Water them, keep an eye out for pests, and tend them daily to harvest your well-earned bounty.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft and build</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forage and gather materials to build and craft items. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your imagination and the available materials to build a simple shelter, or your dream house!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft tools, contraptions and accessories with your handy crafting table.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525290/extras/2e10449832ab420355acc73d376a3c2d.poster.avif?t=1782492179\" width=356 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525290/extras/2e10449832ab420355acc73d376a3c2d.webm?t=1782492179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525290/extras/2e10449832ab420355acc73d376a3c2d.mp4?t=1782492179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Discover a colorful HAND-SCULPTED sandbox adventure </strong>where you grow your own world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Everything in OddFauna is sculpted in clay and painted by hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Befriend wild beasts</strong>, adventure across strange lands. Forage, craft, and build yourself a cozy shelter to stay safe from the elements, all on the back of a TerraBeast. Each character, item and plant in the game is hand-sculpted in clay!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Astor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are an Astor</strong>, a tiny but mighty beast that grows <strong>a living world called a TerraBeast</strong>. You form a special bond, living on their back and nurturing them by collecting diverse flora and fauna to join you on this little living world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beasts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world is filled with OddFauna for you to meet.</strong>  Give them their favorite treats to show you care. Earn their trust and you will receive items, recipes, or maybe even a new party member. Many have special skills to share once befriended. Some are easily found, while other rare types may take some serious exploring to discover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The TerraBeast </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This living world starts out quite small. By nurturing it and building a vibrant biome of flora and fauna on their back, they will grow bigger and bigger, being able to support more life and unlocking new abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your TerraBeast home can migrate to different biomes, exploring mountains, forests, grasslands and archipelagos. Discover lots of new beasts and forgeables in each region. Beware the blighted regions, unless you are properly prepared!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Terraform and grow</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transform your TerraBeast into your own unique paradise. </strong>Terraform the ground like clay: <strong>carve rivers and lakes</strong> to play in, <strong>raise mountains</strong> to gain a better view or <strong>create fields</strong> to farm your favorite treats.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices have an impact on the other OddFauna.</strong> Ovoks love forests, Logurs need lots of water, and Trico's love it hot! Be thoughtful of the diverse flora you plant on your TerraBeast, different environments will attract different beasts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your own crops! There are many different seeds available to grow your very own garden. Water them, keep an eye out for pests, and tend them daily to harvest your well-earned bounty.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft and build</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forage and gather materials to build and craft items. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your imagination and the available materials to build a simple shelter, or your dream house!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft tools, contraptions and accessories with your handy crafting table.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Grow the TerraBeast you live on from a tiny patch of land into a whimsical world! In this fully hand-sculpted, playful systemic sandbox, you'll explore vibrant biomes, farm, craft, build, and befriend the wild OddFauna to create a thriving ecosystem.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“OddFauna's handmade critters are absolute catnip for my crafting game brain.”<br>PC Gamer<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525290/d424b0c5dd1e97142a2275f2f1c453f557a5ea7e/header.jpg?t=1782492179", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525290/22dc5c2fcf6b8f5986d54c67cc9bb3ce7fda57a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782492179", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525290/22dc5c2fcf6b8f5986d54c67cc9bb3ce7fda57a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782492179", "website": "https://oddfauna.games/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 SP1 (64 bit only), Windows 8 (64 bit only), Windows 10 (64 bit only)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> X64 Dual Core CPU, 2+ GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Discrete Non Mobile GPU with 1 GB Ram<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 SP1 (64 bit only), Windows 8 (64 bit only), Windows 10 (64 bit only)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</st